{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 46, "timestamp": 1794206834, "duration": 120.0, "title": "HeatBrief \u2014 Mock MCP demo"}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HHEATBRIEF | AI temperature analyst + client briefing\r\n\r\nSCRIPTED TERMINAL RECORDING \u2014 actual executed commands\r\nMOCK DATA: fictional temperatures, no FortyGuard calls.\r\nSuccess -> evidence -> duplicate replay -> graceful failure -> review.\r\n"]
[8.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H1 / MCP discovery + point measurement\r\n\r\n"]
[8.0, "o", "$ python -m heatbrief.cli ping\r\n\r\n"]
[10.75, "o", "Processing request of type ListToolsRequest\r\nProcessing request of type CallToolRequest\r\n{\r\n  \"tools\": [\r\n    \"env_params\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"measurement\": {\r\n    \"latitude\": 33.4484,\r\n    \"longitude\": -112.074,\r\n    \"temperature\": 35.2,\r\n    \"unit\": \"C\",\r\n    \"observed_at\": \"2025-09-20T14:00:00-07:00\",\r\n    \"source\": \"HeatBrief fictional fixture \\u2014 Mock data\",\r\n    \"source_id\": \"mock-20250920-33.4484--112.074\",\r\n    \"mock\": true\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n[exit 0]\r\n"]
[25.015, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H2 / Compare and save the briefing\r\n\r\n"]
[25.015, "o", "$ python -m heatbrief.cli compare examples/request.json --out reports/demo-recording\r\n\r\n"]
[27.703, "o", "Processing request of type CallToolRequest\r\nProcessing request of type ListToolsRequest\r\nProcessing request of type CallToolRequest\r\nProcessing request of type CallToolRequest\r\n{\r\n  \"status\": \"draft_pending_review\",\r\n  \"replayed\": false,\r\n  \"comparison\": {\r\n    \"mock\": true,\r\n    \"incomplete\": false,\r\n    \"lowest_c\": 34.1,\r\n    \"lowest_locations\": [\r\n      \"Tempe Riverside\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"spread_c\": 2.6,\r\n    \"ranking\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Tempe Riverside\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 34.1\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Phoenix Civic Plaza\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 35.2\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Scottsdale Courtyard\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 36.7\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"output\": \"reports\\\\demo-recording\\\\demo-phoenix-001\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n[exit 0]\r\n"]
[45.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H3 / Evidence-backed report\r\n\r\n"]
[45.0, "o", "# HeatBrief | Temperature comparison\r\n\r\n**Mock data \u2014 fictional demonstration**\r\n\r\nRequest: `demo-phoenix-001` \u00b7 Client: Acme Demo Events \\(fictional\\)\r\nRequested time: 2025-09-20T14:00:00-07:00 (America/Phoenix)\r\n\r\nBusiness question: Which of these three locations has the lowest temperature for our site visit?\r\n\r\n## Finding\r\n\r\nAmong these locations, Tempe Riverside has the lowest temperature at 34\\.1 \u00b0C\\.\r\n\r\nTemperature spread among available readings: 2.6 \u00b0C.\r\nCoverage: 3/3 locations.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n| Location | Coordinates | Temperature | Observed at | Source / evidence ID |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Phoenix Civic Plaza | 33.4484, -112.074 | 35.2 \u00b0C | 2025\\-09\\-20T14:00:00\\-07:00 | HeatBrief fictional fixture \u2014 Mock data / mock\\-20250920\\-33\\.4484\\-\\-112\\.074 |\r\n| Tempe Riverside | 33.4255, -111.94 | 34.1 \u00b0C | 2025\\-09\\-20T14:00:00\\-07:00 | HeatBrief fictional fixture \u2014 Mock data / mock\\-20250920\\-33\\.4255\\-\\-111\\.94 |\r\n| Scottsdale Courtyard | 33.4942, -111.9261 | 36.7 \u00b0C | 2025\\-09\\-20T14:00:00\\-07:00 | HeatBrief fictional fixture \u2014 Mock data / mock\\-20250920\\-33\\.4942\\-\\-111\\.9261 |\r\n\r\n## Limitations\r\n\r\n- Mock data: all readings are fictional; live FortyGuard is unverified\\.\r\n- Only temperature is compared; this does not establish safety for outdoor work or events\\.\r\n- Readings apply only to the stated coordinates and timestamp\\.\r\n- Rankings use Celsius rounded to 0\\.001 degrees; displayed values use one decimal\\.\r\n"]
[70.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H4 / Repeat the request: replay the saved result\r\n\r\n"]
[70.0, "o", "$ python -m heatbrief.cli compare examples/request.json --out reports/demo-recording\r\n\r\n"]
[73.14, "o", "{\r\n  \"status\": \"draft_pending_review\",\r\n  \"replayed\": true,\r\n  \"comparison\": {\r\n    \"mock\": true,\r\n    \"incomplete\": false,\r\n    \"lowest_c\": 34.1,\r\n    \"lowest_locations\": [\r\n      \"Tempe Riverside\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"spread_c\": 2.6,\r\n    \"ranking\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Tempe Riverside\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 34.1\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Phoenix Civic Plaza\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 35.2\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Scottsdale Courtyard\",\r\n        \"temperature_c\": 36.7\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"output\": \"reports\\\\demo-recording\\\\demo-phoenix-001\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n[exit 0]\r\n"]
