[91.343, "o", "{\"error\": \"invalid_request\", \"message\": \"1 validation error for BriefingRequest\\ntimezone\\n  Field required [type=missing, input_value={'request_id': 'demo-miss...longitude': -111.9261}]}, input_type=dict]\\n    For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/2.14/v/missing\"}\r\n\r\n[exit 2]\r\n"]
[106.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H6 / Client handoff\r\n\r\n"]
[106.0, "o", "Report + unsent follow-up are saved once per request ID.\r\nStatus: draft_pending_review. Human review uses a separate API token.\r\nn8n workflow: workflows/client-briefing.json (runtime execution unverified).\r\nLive FortyGuard integration: gated until access and schema are verified.\r\nTemperature alone does not establish outdoor safety.\r\n"]
[120.0, "o", "\r\nDemo complete. No follow-up has been sent.\r\n"]
